<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy | Skill Record</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body style="background: var(--bg-darker); padding: 60px 20px;">

    <div class="auth-card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 30px;">Privacy Policy</h2>
        
        <div style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">
            <p>Your privacy is important to us. It is Skill Record's policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect from you across our website and application.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">1. Information We Collect</strong>
            We only ask for personal information when we truly need it to provide a service to you. We collect it by fair and lawful means, with your knowledge and consent. We collect data such as your name, email address, roll number, and academic records.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">2. Use of Information</strong>
            We use the collected information to facilitate the tracking of internships, enable communication between students and faculty, and improve our services. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">3. Data Storage and Security</strong>
            All user data is securely stored. We employ industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">4. Third-Party Services</strong>
            We may share your data with trusted third-party service providers only when necessary to operate our platform, subject to strict confidentiality agreements.</p>
            
            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">5. Contact Us</strong>
            If you have any questions about how we handle user data and personal information, feel free to contact us at <span style="color: var(--accent);">privacy@skillrecord.com</span>.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 40px;">
            <button type="button" class="cta-btn cta-btn-secondary" style="flex: 1;" onclick="window.location.href='/'">Go Back Home</button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
